{"id":"fanta_stico","lemma":"fantástico","pos":"adj","rank":899,"glosses":["fantastic (existing in fantasy)","fantastic (excellent)"],"ipa":"/fanˈtastiko/","forms":{"feminine":"fantástica","masculinePlural":"fantásticos","femininePlural":"fantásticas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/98/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-fant%C3%A1stico.wav","examples":[{"text":"Estoy seguro de que vas a hacer un trabajo fantástico.","en":"I'm sure you'll do a fantastic job.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582642"},{"text":"Tu casa es fantástica.","en":"Your house is fantastic.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/600040"},{"text":"Era un juego fantástico.","en":"It was a fantastic game."},{"text":"Desde lo alto de aquel árbol hay una vista fantástica.","en":"There's a fantastic view from the top of that tree.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/508322"},{"text":"Fue un fantástico logro.","en":"It was an awesome accomplishment."}]}